{"severity":"DEBUG","time":"2025-11-22T20:16:44+05:45","caller":"resource/repository_impl.go:1424","message":"[prompt-input-and-output]","traceID":"00000000000000000000000000000000","traceSampled":false,"requestID":"MacBook-Pro.local/fBn6sl4UuK-000001","userID":"zpYSlblItaUssJnCzLevDTpL9pg1","authorizedUserID":"zpYSlblItaUssJnCzLevDTpL9pg1","maxTokens":"0","contextWindow":"131072","inferenceSpeed":"3000-tokens-per-sec","output":"Categorical Frequency Tables","provider":"cerebras","baseURL":"https://api.cerebras.ai/v1","system":"You are an expert educational content naming specialist.\nGenerate concise, professional names for educational resources that clearly communicate the learning objectives. \nNames should be:\n- Clear and descriptive\n- Professional and appropriate for educators\n- Free of unnecessary words or marketing language\n- Free of latex and math symbols\n- Use '&' instead of 'and' to keep it concise\n- Focus on learning outcomes and subject content, not resource type\n","user":"\nTask: Generate a name for a lesson plan with the following details:\n- Skills: Analysing and creating frequency tables with categorical data\nRespond with only the name, no explanation or formatting.\nOutput maximum 3 words. Don't include the word \"Lesson\" or \"Plan\" in the name.\n","model":"gpt-oss-120b","rawOutput":"Categorical Frequency Tables","apiCallDurationMs":"690.89","promptLogID":"01KANZMQP8A7ZP6RQ7AH78GKK9","resourceType":"LESSON_PLAN","maxCompletionTokens":"4096","temperature":"0.000000","isReasoningModel":"true","architecture":"MoE","modelType":"reasoning","promptType":"resource_naming","skillIDs":"[OLTlbvQDtNHfBSsyagap]"}
